WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.545 --> 00:00:07.757
When I was your age,
I'd already decided to become an artist.

00:00:08.299 --> 00:00:11.553
I loved painting.
So much that I couldn't sleep.

00:00:12.053 --> 00:00:14.806
Then one day, for no reason,
I couldn't paint.

00:00:16.141 --> 00:00:17.892
I kept painting, but it was no good.

00:00:20.061 --> 00:00:23.440
I realized that I was just
imitating other painters.

00:00:24.149 --> 00:00:26.067
Just copies of paintings I'd seen.

00:00:27.152 --> 00:00:29.320
I swore I'd paint my own pictures.

00:00:30.655 --> 00:00:31.656
That must've been hard.

00:00:33.575 --> 00:00:36.786
But after that...
it's not much easier now.

00:00:37.328 --> 00:00:40.665
I think I found what painting means,
at least for me.

00:00:42.959 --> 00:00:45.670
To fly, you don't chant
a spell or something, right?

00:00:46.671 --> 00:00:47.672
We fly with our spirit.

00:00:48.631 --> 00:00:51.801
A witch's spirit? Perfect!
That's what I'm talking about.

00:00:52.761 --> 00:00:54.763
A witch's spirit. An artist's spirit.

00:00:54.846 --> 00:00:56.264
A baker's spirit!

00:00:57.515 --> 00:01:00.268
I suppose it must be a power given by God.

00:01:00.643 --> 00:01:02.645
Sometimes, you suffer for it.

00:01:04.105 --> 00:01:06.941
I guess I never gave witchcraft
much thought.

00:01:07.776 --> 00:01:10.528
That talk about discipline and training
was so old-fashioned.

00:01:11.863 --> 00:01:14.407
I was so happy that you came
all that way to see me.

00:01:15.283 --> 00:01:18.161
Left alone, I would've been
one giant ball of frustration.

00:01:19.454 --> 00:01:24.375
There have been many times I've thought
of painting over that painting.

00:01:25.376 --> 00:01:26.711
Why? It's so beautiful.

00:01:27.545 --> 00:01:28.671
When I saw you today,

00:01:29.130 --> 00:01:31.674
I saw your sad face
and thought, "I've found it!"

00:01:32.425 --> 00:01:35.178
-I knew I could paint you.
-Not fair!

00:01:37.388 --> 00:01:38.306
Sure it is.

00:01:40.308 --> 00:01:41.893
-Let's go to sleep.
-Okay.

